export anchor LeatherSkeuomorphicStyle:
    number: 30
    screen: SignIn
    name: Leather skeuomorphic
    idea: A 2010-era desk object, a stitched tan leather folio holding a cream ruled paper card, with embossed labels and glossy buttons you want to press.
    base: light
    palette:
        desk: #e9dfcc, the page behind the folio with a fine noise grain
        tanLeather: #c99c6b, the folio cover and the section tabs, with grain
        deepLeather: #a97a4b, the debossed badge and the leather paper corners
        stitch: #f6e7c8, dashed stitching
        creamPaper: #fbf6ea, the card and the style sheet
        ruledLine: #e7dcc4, ruled paper lines and dividers
        ink: #2f2216, text and headings
        embossedBrown: #3b2615, the brand and any text on leather
        muted: #6b5640, the or divider and meta text
        feltGreen: #2f6b3a, the glossy primary button and the checkbox tick
        waxRed: #a3271c, error text and the error field border
        focusBlue: #3d7bc4, the focus glow
        link: #6a3e17, underlined links
    type:
        Georgia, Times New Roman, serif for the brand, headings and asides,
        and Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, system-ui, sans-serif for
        controls. The brand is 34px bold italic serif, the heading 26px
        bold serif, buttons 15 to 16px bold sans, body 15px at 1.5, the
        create account line 16px italic serif, and labels 12px bold
        uppercase sans with 0.06em tracking. All text carries a 1px white
        or cream emboss shadow below.
    layout:
        A leather folio 920px wide on a desk. The left flap, 300px wide,
        holds a round debossed badge with a sun icon, the brand, a one
        line motto and a stitched strap with a brass stud at the bottom.
        The right side is a cream ruled paper card with a pink margin rule,
        held by two stitched leather corners at the top, carrying the form.
        Privacy and Terms sit below the folio. Below 760px the flap becomes
        a short header row with the badge and brand, and the paper fills
        the width.
    spacing: An 8px base on a 28px ruled paper rhythm. 12px between sign-in buttons, 18px between fields and 36 to 40px paper padding.
    density: Medium. Two panels with comfortable controls.
    corners: 14px on the folio, 8px on buttons, 6px on fields and notes, 4px on the paper.
    borders: Dashed 2px cream stitching inset 8px on all leather. 1px tan borders on buttons and wells. A pink margin rule on the paper.
    shadows:
        Lit from above. Inset shadows on fields and the badge, a soft drop
        under the folio and paper, 1px white highlights on top edges, and
        glossy buttons split by a hard highlight at the half line.
    icons:
        A line sun debossed into the leather badge, round letter coins G
        and M on sign-in buttons, a filled triangle with an exclamation
        mark in a pale red note for the error, and a tick in the checkbox.
    focus: A 2px white gap then a 3px blue glow ring around buttons and rows. A focused field gets a blue border and a soft 3px blue glow.
    tone: Warm and personal, a little old-fashioned, such as Projects for small teams, kept in one well-worn folio.
